Swift-version stamp — Truvio.Commerce.Storefront

target: swift/2.3
policy: rolling latest-only (STOREFRONT-PHASE D-constraints; harness .claude/CLAUDE.md)

This storefront targets the current latest Swift release (2.4) and the content it
consumes is supplied by the headless baseline `baseline/headless/2.4`. When Swift 2.5
ships, maintenance rolls forward and this stamp is updated to `swift/2.5`; the prior
version is dropped (no back-support, no multi-version matrix).

The path `swift/2.4` intentionally mirrors the ecosystem convention used by the
Baselines catalog (`baseline/swift/2.4/`) and DemoThemes release tags (`swift/2.4.x`).
